---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About CUMID | Pocket Diaries with Personality" description="CUMID is a stationery project for square pocket diaries with expressive covers and top spiral binding, made for everyday notes.">
  <article class="store-width story-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About CUMID</p><h1>A small space for<br />whatever’s on your mind.</h1>
    <p>CUMID started with an idea: a diary cover can say as much about you as what you write inside it. A dry joke, a favourite machine, a little ghost or a patch of purple flowers.</p>
    <h2>One format. Your kind of cover.</h2><p>We’re developing square pocket diaries with the spiral along the top edge. A simple format for to-do lists, sketches and notes you want to keep close.</p>
    <h2>Help choose what comes next.</h2><p>The catalogue shows our cover concepts. There is no ready stock yet. Tell us which design you like on WhatsApp, and we’ll share pricing, materials and availability when confirmed.</p>
    <a href={SITE.whatsappBaseUrl} class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Talk to CUMID ↗</a>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
